         "label": "Automation Intro Comm Op",
         "name": "widget_1780635858354",
         "params": {
          "additional_bold_text": "Flieber is already built. You just use it.",
          "content": "<h2>Your brand doesn\u2019t have to become an AI company to <strong>run on it.</strong><span></span></h2>\n<p><span>Running a brand on AI usually means standing up your own models, wiring them to your systems, and figuring out the commerce use cases yourself. Flieber is all of that \u2014 already built for commerce: demand planning, multichannel operations, and the edge cases a general-purpose tool has never seen.</span><span></span></p>\n<p><span>You describe what you need; Flieber does the rest. No prompt engineers, no plugin stack, no infrastructure to maintain.</span><span></span></p>",
