          },
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "fliber_boder_text": "<p>\u201cFlieber considers everything no other software picks up. It killed our Amazon stockouts.\u201d</p>\n<p><i>Tehsin Rashad, Operations Manager, Lifepro Fitness</i></p>",
          "module_id": 214374188579,
          "platfiorm_section_one": {
           "platform_col_border_text": "<p><strong>Demo </strong>Connect your data. Get forecasts, plans, and drafted POs \u2014 verified by you, approved in one click.</p>",
           "platform_col_content": "<h3>AI inventory planning, <strong>trained on commerce.</strong></h3>\n<p>Inventory connects every channel, every warehouse, every supplier, and forecasts demand at the SKU level on a custom engine built with Nixtla\u2019s TimeGPT. Replenishment recommendations. Drafted POs. Stockout risk flagged before it hits.</p>\n<p>Built for the edge cases other tools break on: kits, bundles, preorders, backorders, messy historical data.</p>",
           "platform_col_small_heading": "<p><strong>Inventory </strong>Flieber Inventory</p>"
          },
          "platform_button": {
           "no_follow": false,
           "open_in_new_tab": false,
           "url": {
            "href": "https://www.flieber.com/product",
            "type": "EXTERNAL"
           }
          },
          "platform_col_border_text": "",
          "platform_col_content": "<h2>AI inventory planning, <strong>trained on commerce.</strong></h2>\n<p>Inventory connects every channel, every warehouse, every supplier, and forecasts demand at the SKU level on a custom engine built with Nixtla\u2019s TimeGPT. Replenishment recommendations. Drafted POs. Stockout risk flagged before it hits.</p>\n<p>Built for the edge cases other tools break on: kits, bundles, preorders, backorders, messy historical data.</p>",
          "platform_col_image": {
