          "platform_col_small_heading": "<p><strong>Inventory</strong></p>",
          "platform_main_heading": "<h2>One platform. <strong>Two products.</strong></h2>\n<p>Built on one Retail-Ready AI foundation. Use either. Or both, and they work better together.</p>",
