         "label": "Blue Build Comm op",
         "name": "widget_1780654058841",
         "params": {
          "css_class": "dnd-module",
          "interact_text": "See the platform in action. 30 minute walkthrough.",
          "module_id": 214405267335,
          "schema_version": 2,
          "section_head": "<h2><strong>Plug</strong> in your data. <strong>Prompt </strong>your way to<strong> </strong>automation.&nbsp;</h2>\n<p><span>Connect your existing systems and Flieber shapes itself around how your business actually runs;&nbsp;your channels, your SKUs, your rules. From there, you don't configure, you describe: tell Flieber what you want automated, and it builds it. Setup is free, and your data stays yours \u2014 always.</span></p>",
          "step_card": [
           {
            "build_step_image": {
             "alt": "Composable-img",
             "height": 1592,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 1000,
             "max_width": 2000,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Composable-img.png",
             "width": 3184
            },
            "mobile_img": {
             "alt": "comp-mob",
             "height": 852,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 852,
             "max_width": 952,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/comp-mob.webp",
             "width": 952
            },
            "step_content": "<h3>Works with what you already have.</h3>\n<p><span>Plug Flieber into your existing tech stack. Connect your sales channels, warehouses, and fulfillment partners, and Flieber builds a data structure ready for AI consumption.</span></p>",
            "step_sub_head": {
             "step_no": "01",
             "step_sub_title": "Composable"
            }
           },
           {
            "build_step_image": {
             "alt": "Self-serve-img",
             "height": 920,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 1384,
             "max_width": 1444,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/Self-serve-img.webp",
             "width": 960
            },
            "mobile_img": {
             "alt": "self-mob-img",
             "height": 852,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 859,
             "max_width": 960,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/self-mob-img.webp",
             "width": 952
            },
            "step_content": "<h3>Build anything. Without an AI team.</h3>\n<p><span>Describe a workflow in plain English and Flieber builds it for you. Agents, automations, apps. No engineers, no complex setup.</span></p>",
            "step_sub_head": {
             "step_no": "02",
             "step_sub_title": "Self-serve AI"
            }
           },
           {
            "build_step_image": {
             "alt": "grounded-img-LARGE",
             "height": 920,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 1384,
             "max_width": 1444,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/grounded-img-LARGE.webp",
             "width": 960
            },
            "mobile_img": {
             "alt": "grounded-img-SMALL",
             "height": 928,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 936,
             "max_width": 960,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/grounded-img-SMALL.webp",
             "width": 952
            },
            "step_content": "<h3>Decisions backed by accurate data.</h3>\n<p><span>Every recommendation is grounded in your real sales, inventory, and supply chain data. Not averages. No guesswork.</span></p>",
            "step_sub_head": {
             "step_no": "03",
             "step_sub_title": "Grounded"
            }
           },
           {
            "build_step_image": {
             "alt": "Private-img",
             "height": 488,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 1017,
             "max_width": 2000,
             "size_type": "auto_custom_max",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/Private-img.webp",
             "width": 960
            },
            "mobile_img": {
             "alt": "private-mob-img",
             "height": 1360,
             "loading": "lazy",
             "max_height": 1360,
             "max_width": 956,
             "size_type": "auto",
             "src": "https://5767502.fs1.hubspotusercontent-na1.net/hubfs/5767502/Optimized%202026%20v2/private-mob-img.webp",
             "width": 956
            },
            "step_content": "<h3><span>Safer than handing your data to an AI yourself.</span></h3>\n<p><span>When you use LLMs directly, your data gets pasted straight into someone else's model. Flieber doesn't work that way. It acts on your data without exposing it, reaching an AI model only when a question actually requires it. So your competitive edge isn't sitting in a chatbot someone else can learn from.</span></p>",
            "step_sub_head": {
             "step_no": "04",
             "step_sub_title": "Private"
            }
           }
          ],
